{"_meta":{"openai/fileParams":["cvFile"],"openai/outputTemplate":"ui://matchaa/resume-result-v1.html","openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Tailored resume ready","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Tailoring your resume to the job post\u2026","securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}],"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://matchaa/resume-result-v1.html"}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Use this when the user provides a resume or CV (attached PDF or pasted text) and a specific job posting, and wants a tailored resume as a finished PDF. One call does everything: reads the resume, analyzes the job post, rewords the experience with the posting's vocabulary without inventing skills, fits it on one page and returns the PDF with a preview card. Works for any job, internship or apprenticeship (alternance), in French or English. Pass the job post text; resolve a job URL to its text first. The resume is written in the job post's language. Optional: guestToken returned by an earlier Matchaa call, templateId when the user asked for a design, language only when the user wants another resume language. Do not use for cover letters, interview preparation or general career advice. For changes to a delivered resume, use update_resume or rewrite_resume_section with the returned operationId and guestToken.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"cvFile":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"download_url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"},"file_id":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"file_name":{"type":"string"},"mime_type":{"type":"string"}},"required":["download_url","file_id"],"type":"object"},"cvText":{"maxLength":80000,"minLength":20,"type":"string"},"guestToken":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":40,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"language":{"enum":["fr","en"],"type":"string"},"offerText":{"maxLength":20000,"minLength":20,"type":